// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P922061248" "I'm going to take a chance on you, {VillainName}. This isn't something I'd do for everyone. But you've shown me enormous potential, and I truly believe you may be one of those special few destined to bring about Arachnos' great future. So I'm going to send you on an official Arachnos operation. Arachnos has had a brief skirmish with the Snakes, and we need someone to mop up the last stragglers in the area. Just don't embarrass me. Remember, this is your chance to be Arachnos' ally. If you don't take advantage of it, you could become our enemy."
// AcceptString :
"P3537257120" "Mop up the stragglers"
// SendOffString :
"P4070638390" "We'll fly you to the area. Once you're there, I hope you'll aquit yourself well."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2317116459" "Defeat all Snakes in area"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1781613048" "You're charged with an Arachnos operation. Default on your mission, and no one on this island will be with you."

